Academic benchmarks and the scope of the comparison (@greek-academic-benchmarks: 0, is #reference, #part-of @greek-scholarly-sources) { r_7YDPSHERTRH41D7YR4P93PWNEP
The research progression is informed by identifiable institutional evidence, with different roles:

| Source | Evidence and appropriate use |
| --- | --- |
| [PUCRS Philosophy programme](https://portal.pucrs.br/ensino/mestrado-e-doutorado/filosofia/) | The Master's/doctoral catalogue includes Greek reception in ethics, metaphysics, and epistemology, research-project discussion, qualification, and defence. Catalogue entries do not establish a current semester offering. |
| [UFRGS: Spinelli, 2010](https://lume.ufrgs.br/handle/10183/26907) | Doctoral research connecting knowledge, legislation, education, and the Nicomachean Ethics; a bounded research-output example. |
| [UFRGS: Wagner, 2022](https://lume.ufrgs.br/handle/10183/248043) | Doctoral research on disposition, habituation, and moral education; the repository abstract identifies an argued educational problem. |
| [UNICAMP HF701, 2026/1](https://www.dac.unicamp.br/portal/caderno-de-horarios/2026/1/S/P/IFCH/HF701) | An actual graduate bibliography combines Parmenides, Republic VI–VII, and Sophist with Greek/French editions and commentary. Its general syllabus field is unpublished. |
| [Paris 1 L3/S5 outline](https://gramata.pantheonsorbonne.fr/sites/default/files/inline-files/L3S5_philosophie%20ancienne_medievale_arabe-1.pdf) | An undated published advanced-undergraduate outline connects desire, knowledge, and ethics through multiple texts and scholarship. |

References checked 2026-10-26. UFRGS thesis records are examples of research scope, not evidence for a prescribed course bibliography. The selected materials do not amount to a complete audit of either institution's degrees.

The [problem families](../research/seminars/Seminars.lingua#r_5FTSQDJTR924S9Z0G9EDBQFR1Y), two-study requirement, Greek dossier, and [terminal criteria](../research/Research-completion.lingua#r_41G7P2Y9HYXMVAF53MV2QYT1CD) are Lince's authored choices informed by these benchmarks. The academically demanding work is made explicit in those requirements rather than inferred from a book list or a course label.

